  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The primary dataset discovery layer of the European Health Data Space (EHDS), operated by the European Commission. Directly implements HealthDCAT-AP and serves as a reference deployment of that standard at EU scale. Marked Assess rather than Adopt because the EHDS rollout is still in progress — the EHDS Regulation entered into force in March 2025 and full cross-border data exchange is not expected until 2029. The open-source codebase (EUPL-1.2) is the deployable artifact for organisations building EHDS-compatible catalogues.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-13",
